# app.pipe
#
# Placeholder — there's no established convention for a .pipe file in this stack
# (FastAPI backend, Streamlit dashboard, React Native mobile app). Named pipes
# (FIFOs) are normally an OS-level IPC primitive created at runtime with mkfifo,
# not a file checked into source control, so this is just a reserved spot: replace
# this content with whatever this file is actually meant to hold.
